Option C: He was a painter.
[DA] Hvad er P.S. Krøyer (1851-1909) særlig kendt for?  A: Han var forfatter  |  B: Han var komponist  |  C: Han var kunstmaler

104
00:11:34.924 --> 00:11:37.474
The answer is C: He was a painter.

105
